    "summary": "Once per turn as your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) starts, a **CROWE'S SANCTIFIERS** unit of yours starts this [action](vsdata:core-rule/performing-actions) in range of an **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** not yet **sanctified**. As your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) ends, or the battle if sooner, that [objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives) becomes **sanctified** by your army unless the unit is **[battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)**.",
